# ── Not needed at runtime ──
#
# Only these two. landing/, demo/, blog/ and docs/ look like source material
# but the application SERVES them — /demo, /docs and the blog are routes, and
# excluding them here would 404 those pages on the deployed instance. The
# packaging fix in 0.3.2 is what puts them in the wheel for the same reason.
tests/
integrations/
